      "normative_level": "MAY",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "bgp",
      "stage": "bgp_fsm",
      "description": "If the same key is used for multiple peers, the offered security services may be degraded, e.g., due to an increased risk of compromise at one router that adversely affects other routers.",
